WEBVTT

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:01.163
And it's so important --

00:09:01.163 --> 00:09:02.797
Here's one of the things:

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:05.463
Mourning is what we do on the outside.

00:09:05.497 --> 00:09:07.830
Grief is what's inside of us.

00:09:07.863 --> 00:09:10.163
I can't make you grieve.

00:09:10.163 --> 00:09:13.130
I can't make my kids grieve.

00:09:13.163 --> 00:09:16.097
All we can do is model healthy grief.

00:09:16.597 --> 00:09:19.797
And how do we model
healthy grief for our children?

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:23.530
We tell them part of our work
is to grieve fully.

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:25.463
It's OK to be sad.

00:09:25.463 --> 00:09:28.163
It's OK to miss that person.

00:09:28.163 --> 00:09:29.997
And to live fully.